A ridiculous story about a guy who gets pranked. Surreally stupid. For those who look for more meaning in every film, let's just say it's a satire on the current situation in offices across the world thanks to sub-standard education. 
The total budget of the film was about $0. No lights. Shot on a Nikon D7000. The editing was done on Adobe Premiere Pro CS5, along with Magic Bullet for colouring and After Effects for Noise reduction. Looking for more tips and scripts for making more Zero Budget films.